{"t":"Naginata Quest","s":"naginata-quest-ce6a8","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Naginata_Quest_Map_1_32f8f5.png","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Naginata Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">40<br/>(50+ recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>Deep inside a dragon-filled place a treasure is hidden...\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais%20Dragon%20Lair\">Thais Dragon Lair</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Snake\">Snake</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Spider\">Spider</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rotworm\">Rotworms</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Carrion%20Worm\">Carrion Worms</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Hatchling\">Dragon Hatchlings</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord%20Hatchling\">Dragon Lord Hatchlings</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lords</a>. Possible lured  <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops\">Cyclopes</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Naginata\">Naginata</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_Equipment\">Required Equipment</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pick\">Pick</a></li>\n<li>Recommended <a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field\">Destroy Field</a> runes</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Go into the cave north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Alatar%20Lake\">Alatar Lake</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32357,32085,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32357, 32085, 7)</a>).</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Follow the passage to the south-east, and go down another level.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Naginata Quest Map 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"117\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Naginata_Quest_Map_1_32f8f5.png\" width=\"129\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Continue to the south, and then to the east. Go up the ladder.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Naginata Quest Map 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"105\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Naginata_Quest_Map_2_91f88a.png\" width=\"86\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Follow this short passage to the south-west and go down <b>two</b> levels.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Naginata Quest Map 3a\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Naginata_Quest_Map_3a_7cce19.png\" width=\"99\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Naginata Quest Map 3b\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"88\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Naginata_Quest_Map_3b_1be44a.png\" width=\"97\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Follow this passage around to the south, and go up.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Naginata Quest Map 4\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"126\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Naginata_Quest_Map_4_f29778.png\" width=\"87\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Go directly west, and then down a level.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Naginata Quest Map 5\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"62\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Naginata_Quest_Map_5_537bbe.png\" width=\"75\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Follow the passage north and go down again.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Naginata Quest Map 6a\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"129\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Naginata_Quest_Map_6a_b04587.png\" width=\"121\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>In this room, Go up a level to enter the Dragon Lair.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Naginata Quest Map 6b\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"80\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Naginata_Quest_Map_6b_913f86.png\" width=\"77\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>In the dragon lair, you will encounter many <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a> from all directions. There will also be one or two <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lords</a> in the north end of the room.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Go to the small room in to the north. There will be a large rock over a hole. Use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Pick\">Pick</a> on the rock until the rock breaks, then go down the hole. <b>WARNING!</b> While destroying the rock you lose Hitpoints.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Naginata Quest Map 07\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"216\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Naginata_Quest_Map_07_689bc0.jpg\" width=\"169\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Here will be a hole on the other side of the level 40 <a href=\"#/wiki/Gate%20of%20Expertise\">Door of Expertise</a>. Down the hole will be 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lords</a> (very slow <a href=\"#/wiki/Respawn\">Respawn</a>).</li></ul>\n<ul><li>The reward is in a chest in the north end of this room.</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":[]}